      "briefTitle": "Effect of Repaglinide and Metformin Combination Tablet or Rosiglitazone and Metformin in Fixed Dose Combination on Blood Glucose Control in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes",
      "officialTitle": "Repaglinide and Metformin Combination Tablet (NN4440) in a TID Regimen Compared to a BID Regimen and BID Avandamet in Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes: A Twenty-Six Week, Open-Label, Multicenter, Randomized, Parallel Group Trial to Investigate Efficacy and Safety"
    },
